 "segmentos": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.94,
   "texto": "Why is the sun cancer rate up?"
  },
  {
   "s": 3.22,
   "e": 5.2,
   "texto": "The sunscreen paradox is really, it's real."
  },
  {
   "s": 5.5,
   "e": 7.34,
   "texto": "And we are using sunscreen more than ever,"
  },
  {
   "s": 7.56,
   "e": 9.98,
   "texto": "but one in five women get skin cancer"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.98,
   "e": 12.16,
   "texto": "and one in seven men get skin cancer."
  },
  {
   "s": 12.32,
   "e": 14.54,
   "texto": "It's the most prevalent form of cancer."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.84,
   "e": 17.8,
   "texto": "For a problem like this, you have to start by measuring it."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.88,
   "e": 19.38,
   "texto": "And we have never had a tool"
  },
  {
   "s": 19.38,
   "e": 21.8,
   "texto": "to really measure the exposure that we've had"
  },
  {
   "s": 21.8,
   "e": 22.96,
   "texto": "on a long-term basis."
  },
  {
   "s": 23.32,
   "e": 25.28,
   "texto": "I mean, awareness is really the first step."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.3,
   "e": 27.16,
   "texto": "What are the massive blind spots"
  },
  {
   "s": 27.16,
   "e": 28.94,
   "texto": "that dermatologists are missing?"
  },
  {
   "s": 28.94,
   "e": 30.98,
   "texto": "Dermatology community has been"
  },
  {
   "s": 30.98,
   "e": 32.48,
   "texto": "very black or white on this issue."
  },
  {
   "s": 32.72,
   "e": 35.6,
   "texto": "You apply sunscreen and you supplement with vitamin D."
  },
  {
   "s": 35.78,
   "e": 35.94,
   "texto": "Right."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.1,
   "e": 38.36,
   "texto": "I think the blind spot is the lack of data"
  },
  {
   "s": 38.36,
   "e": 41.32,
   "texto": "and we're going to be providing that data to people."
  },
  {
   "s": 41.62,
   "e": 43.0,
   "texto": "But this is all about empowerment"
  },
  {
   "s": 43.0,
   "e": 45.52,
   "texto": "because our thinking on this has really evolved"
  },
  {
   "s": 45.52,
   "e": 49.34,
   "texto": "to understand how sunlight impacts our overall health."
  },
  {
   "s": 49.7,
   "e": 51.42,
   "texto": "To me, this is the best wearable"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.42,
   "e": 53.38,
   "texto": "because it's teaching me to be preventative"
  },
  {
   "s": 53.38,
   "e": 55.26,
   "texto": "and aware of my sun exposure."
  }
 ]
